1795359136907	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-7254547656835003151"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T09:52:16.907-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T09:52:16.907-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-rb2"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-britannia"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"रोमन ब्रिटानियाको कथा, भाग २: रोमन ब्रिटानियाको जन्म"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"भकभकाउने विद्वान् सम्राट्ले सिजरले नसकेको काम कसरी पूरा गरे — र पराजित भएर बस्न नमान्ने टापुमा के भयोउनको नाम ह्यानिबल बार्का (Hannibal Barca) थियो, र रोमलाई ध्वस्त पार्न निस्किँदा उनी जम्मा उनन्तीस वर्षका थिए। स.पू. २१८ को शरद ऋतुमा उनले स्पेनको तटस्थित कार्टाजेनामा एउटा विशाल सेना जम्मा गरे—करिब नब्बे हजार पैदल सैनिक, बाह्र हजार घोडचढी र सैंतीस वटा युद्धहात्ती।त्यसपछि उनले त्यो सेनालाई पूर्वतिर "},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/7254547656835003151/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/roman-britannia-bhag-2-roman-britanniako-janma.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7254547656835003151"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7254547656835003151"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/roman-britannia-bhag-2-roman-britanniako-janma.html","title":"रोमन ब्रिटानियाको कथा, भाग २: रोमन ब्रिटानियाको जन्म"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://